<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px">
  <h1 style="font-size:22px;margin:0 0 8px">⏰ Don’t break the streak, <%= @user.display_name %>!</h1>
  <p style="color:#475569">Quick nudge to complete <strong><%= @habit.title %></strong> today. Current streak: <strong><%= @habit.streak %> days</strong>.</p>
  <p><a href="<%= root_url %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#1B1031;color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">Open Momentum</a></p>
  <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px">You got this reminder because you set <%= @habit.reminder_time&.strftime("%H:%M") %> on this habit. Archive the habit or clear the time to stop.</p>
</div>
